Name      : PlotXY
Params    : 2
Short     : Appends a new point to the  point's collection.
Remarks   : Adding points does not adjust the plotting area. If the new point falls outside boundaries then the <A  href="..\IDMGraphCtrl\SetRange.htm">SetRange</A> or <A  href="..\IDMGraphCtrl\SetRange.htm">Autorange</> methods must be invoked.
