Name      : PlotY
Params    : 1
Short     : Appends a new point to the point's collection.
Remarks   : X value is computed using the point collection size (for first added point X is zero, then one etc.).\r\n<P>\r\nAdding points does not adjust the plotting area. If the new point falls outside boundaries then the <A  href="..\IDMGraphCtrl\SetRange.htm">SetRange</A> or <A  href="..\IDMGraphCtrl\SetRange.htm">Autorange</> methods must be invoked.
Return    : 
Group     : (default)
