ExampleJS : 
___________
Name      : Y
Short     : 
Remarks   : 
___________
Name      : Plot
Params    : 2
Short     : Replaces all existing points with new ones then plots them.
Remarks   : Replacing all existing points with new ones does not adjust the plotting area. If the new points fall outside boundaries then the <A  href="..\IDMGraphCtrl\SetRange.htm">SetRange</A> or <A  href="..\IDMGraphCtrl\SetRange.htm">Autorange</> methods must be invoked.\r\n<P>\r\nThe type for both parameters is VARIANT. This VARIANT must contain a unidimensional SAFEARRAY. The array elements must be numbers. The following types are accepted for elements (there is an attempt to convert to double): 
Return    : 
